ed for Transformer-based models, used to distill knowledge from teacher BERT.', 'A method used to transfer knowledge from a larger teacher model (BERT) to a smaller student model (TinyBERT).', 'A knowledge distillation (KD) method specifically designed for Transformer networks.', 'A distillation technique applied to transfer knowledge from a teacher model (BERT) to a student model (TinyBERT).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 12]}, 'Knowledge distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger, more complex model (teacher) to a smaller, more efficient model (student).', 'A technique where a smaller "student" model learns from a larger "teacher" model, transferring knowledge and potentially improving performance.', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (BERT) to a smaller one (TinyBERT).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 12]}, 'Knowledge Distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A method to transfer knowledge from a larger model (teacher) to a smaller model (student).', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger, more complex model (teacher) to a smaller, more efficient model (student).', 'The method used in TinyBERT to improve the performance of student models.', 'The general method used to train TinyBERT.', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (BERT) to a smaller one (TinyBERT).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 6, 10, 11, 12]}, 'Embedding layer output': {'description': ['One of the representations from BERT layers used in the proposed distillation method.', 'The output of the embedding layer, which is one of the representations from BERT layers used in the Transformer distillation method.', 'The output of the embedding layer, used as a component in the loss function for the Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Hidden states': {'description': ['Representations derived from the Transformer layer, used in the proposed distillation method.', 'The hidden states derived from the Transformer layer, which are used in the Transformer distillation method.', 'The hidden states derived from the Transformer layer, used as a component in the loss function for the Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Attention matrices': {'description': ['Representations derived from the Transformer layer, used in the proposed distillation method.', 'Intermediate representation within the Transformer, used as a behavior function in knowledge distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 6]}, 'Logits output': {'description': ['The output from the prediction layer, used in the proposed distillation method.', 'The logits output by the prediction layer, which is one of the representations from BERT layers used in the Transformer distillation method.', 'The logits output by the prediction layer, used as a component in the loss function for the Transformer distillation method.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Attention Matrices': {'description': ['The attention matrices derived from the Transformer layer, which are used in the Transformer distillation method.', 'The attention matrices derived from the Transformer layer, used as a component in the loss function for the Transformer distillation method.', 'Intermediate representation within the Transformer, used as a behavior function in knowledge distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 6]}, 'pre-training': {'description': ['The initial stage of training a model, where it learns general domain knowledge.', 'The initial stage where the model learns general language representations from a large corpus of text data, before being fine-tuned for specific tasks. This is a crucial phase for General Distillation.'], 'type': ['task'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 4]}, 'data augmentation': {'description': ['The process of creating new training data from existing data to improve model performance.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 4]}, 'Task-specific distillation stage': {'description': ['The specific objective or goal of the distillation process, which is to transfer knowledge from a teacher model to a student model in a task-oriented manner.', 'A distillation technique where a student model (BERT SMALL) learns task-specific knowledge from a teacher model (BERT BASE).'], 'type': ['method', 'task'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 4]}, 'Transformer Distillation': {'description': ['The specific method being proposed within the context of TinyBERT, which aims to transfer linguistic knowledge from a teacher BERT model.', 'The objective of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model, specifically for Transformer-based models.', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer models.'], 'type': ['task', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [4, 12, 6]}, 'GLUE tasks': {'description': ['Tasks used to evaluate the performance of language models.', 'The General Language Understanding Evaluation (GLUE) benchmark tasks, used for evaluating the performance of the TinyBERT model.', 'A benchmark dataset used for evaluating natural language understanding systems.', 'A benchmark for evaluating the performance of natural language understanding models.', 'A set of natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of language models.', 'A collection of natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'type': ['dataset', 'task'], 'source_chunk_index': [9, 10, 5]}, 'Knowledge Distillation': {'description': ['A method used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (teacher) to a smaller model (student).', 'The general method used by TinyBERT to transfer knowledge from a teacher model to a student model.', 'The general method used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (BERT) to a smaller model (TinyBERT). The text mentions a new KD method for Transformer-based distillation.', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (teacher) to a smaller model (student).', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger model (BERT) to a smaller one (TinyBERT).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [10, 12, 5, 15]}, 'Feed-Forward Network (FFN)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within the Transformer architecture.', 'A component within the Transformer architecture, consisting of linear transformations and ReLU activation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [5, 6]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ['A type of distillation applied to the embedding layer of the Transformer model.', 'A baseline method for TinyBERT learning.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 6]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ['A type of distillation applied to the prediction layer of the Transformer model.', 'A distillation process applied to the prediction layer of the model.', 'A distillation technique applied for 3 epochs in task-specific distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 6, 7]}, 'Pre-training stage': {'description': ['The initial stage of training a model, such as BERT, before fine-tuning.', 'The initial stage where the model learns general language representations from a large corpus of text data, before being fine-tuned for specific tasks. This is a crucial phase for General Distillation.'], 'type': ['task', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 6]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ['A distillation approach that fine-tunes TinyBERT using task-specific datasets, improving performance on downstream tasks.', 'A distillation approach applied to augmented datasets for specific tasks.', 'A method to boost the performances of TinyBERT by continuing on learning the task-specific knowledge of fine-tuned teacher BERT BASE.', 'A distillation technique where a student model (BERT SMALL) learns task-specific knowledge from a teacher model (BERT BASE).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 14, 7]}, 'Data augmentation': {'description': ['The process of augmenting the training data, using word-level replacement.', 'A method proposed in the text.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [8, 11, 13]}, 'Task-specific Distillation (TD)': {'description': ['A procedure within the TinyBERT framework.', 'A distillation technique where a student model (BERT SMALL) learns task-specific knowledge from a teacher model (BERT BASE).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 11]}, 'Transformer-layer distillation (No Trm)': {'description': ['A baseline method for TinyBERT learning.', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer models.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 12]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation (No Pred)': {'description': ['A baseline method for TinyBERT learning.', 'A distillation technique applied for 3 epochs in task-specific distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 14]}, 'Transformer-layer distillation': {'description': ['A key component of TinyBERT learning, used for knowledge distillation within Transformer layers.', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer models.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'Appendix C': {'description': ['Details about experiments, likely including experimental setup, results, and analysis, as referenced in the paper.'], 'type': ['dataset'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'Knowledge transfer': {'description': ['The process of transferring knowledge from teacher models (e.g., BERT LARGE, XLNet LARGE) to student models (TinyBERT).', 'The process of transferring knowledge from the teacher BERT to the student TinyBERT.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher model (BERT BASE) to a student model (BERT SMALL or TinyBERT). This is a core aspect of the distillation process.'], 'type': ['method', 'task'], 'source_chunk_index': [16, 13]}, 'Learning rate': {'description': ['The learning rate used for intermediate layer distillation, specifically 5e-5 for 10 epochs on the augmented dataset, and 3e-5 for prediction layer distillation for 3 epochs.', 'The learning rate used during the training process. Specifically, the text mentions learning rates of 5e-5 and 3e-5 for different distillation phases.', 'The learning rate of 5e-5 used for the prediction-layer distillation on the original training dataset.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 15]}, 'Batch size': {'description': ['The batch size used for intermediate layer distillation, specifically 32 for 10 epochs on the augmented dataset, and 32 for prediction layer distillation for 3 epochs. Also, 256 for tasks like MNLI, QQP and QNLI.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [14]}}
